help/congP x y P (pair X1/1 X1/2) (pair X2/1 X2/2) (pair X3/1 X3/2) :- help/congP/1 x y P X1/1 X2/1 X3/1 , help/congP/2 x y P X1/2 X2/2 X3/2.

